    "about_status": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n.amoura-status{padding:48px 0 64px}\n.amoura-status__box{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.55fr) minmax(0,1.45fr);gap:56px;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(74,16,42,.18);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(74,16,42,.18)}\n.amoura-status__label{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#744D5E}\n.amoura-status__label:before{content:\"\";width:30px;height:1px;background:rgba(74,16,42,.28);margin-top:7px}\n.amoura-status__content h2{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:clamp(28px,2.8vw,40px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:400;color:#4A102A;margin:0 0 14px}\n.amoura-status__content p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.68;color:#3E3337;margin:0;max-width:52rem}\n.amoura-status__actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n.amoura-status__actions a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid #4A102A;color:#4A102A;text-decoration:none}\n.amoura-status__actions a:first-child{background:#4A102A;color:#F4EDE7}\n@media(max-width:749px){.amoura-status__box{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.amoura-status{padding:38px 0 52px}}\n</style>\n{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' %}\n<section class=\"amoura-status\"><div class=\"amoura-status__box\"><div class=\"amoura-status__label\">Prototype status</div><div class=\"amoura-status__content\"><h2>We are validating the model before calling it a finished offer.</h2><p>Amoura is currently a concept and experience prototype. Product names, prices, visuals, claims and verification statuses shown here are test content. They are used to validate the customer journey and the operating model, not to represent a final commercial assortment or a completed compliance assessment.</p><div class=\"amoura-status__actions\"><a href=\"/en/pages/collections\">Explore the prototype</a><a href=\"/en/pages/contact\">Share feedback</a></div></div></div></section>\n{% else %}\n<section class=\"amoura-status\"><div class=\"amoura-status__box\"><div class=\"amoura-status__label\">Status prototypu</div><div class=\"amoura-status__content\"><h2>Walidujemy model, zanim nazwiemy go gotową ofertą.</h2><p>Amoura jest obecnie koncepcją i prototypem doświadczenia marki. Nazwy produktów, ceny, wizualizacje, deklaracje i statusy weryfikacji pokazane w tym serwisie są treścią testową. Służą do walidacji customer journey i modelu operacyjnego, a nie do przedstawiania finalnego asortymentu ani zakończonej oceny zgodności.</p><div class=\"amoura-status__actions\"><a href=\"/pages/kolekcje\">Zobacz prototyp oferty</a><a href=\"/pages/contact\">Podziel się feedbackiem</a></div></div></div></section>\n{% endif %}",
